2result.sql
```

Reason:  
• Includes data from the full 2014‑2024 window, satisfying the “past 10 years” requirement (1result.sql stops at 2023).  
• Builds a point from latitude/longitude when event_point is null, so it captures every hail record that has coordinates (0result.sql drops those rows by relying solely on event_point).  
• Uses case‑sensitive equality on event_type but all tables store the value as lowercase “hail”; nevertheless the query can be easily adjusted if needed, and the more complete spatial coverage still makes it the most accurate of the three.